{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうございます♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れました(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3rdシングルをもって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の最年長"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の姉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉は卒業することになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉が悩みに悩んでの卒業という答えだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、すっごくすっごく寂しいけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉の決めた道だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達が背中をおしてあげなきゃね!*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしも、何かあればすぐに連絡してほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、陽菜の相談も聞いてほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のゆみ姉じゃなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉のことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ大好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても尊敬する人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか、今お別れみたいだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連絡だっていつでもできるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、ゆみ姉が出るイベントだってあるもんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉、いつもありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、文化祭でした＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1378949/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスパーカーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木カラー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/